From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zrmnelson <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:36:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] qt: add the Omarchy colour scheme

Append an Omarchy scheme to ColorSchemeModel (stock System/Day/Night keep their
indices) and let omarchy_default make it the default and stop the first-run
wizard overriding it. SystemPalette::makeOmarchyPalette() substitutes the theme's
colours for the base colours of the stock palettes and lets upstream derive every
state; foreground lines read the theme foreground, and a final pass raises any
text/background pair below 4.5:1. MainCtx owns the OmarchyTheme, warns once when
the theme file is missing, and maps the scheme to Qt::ColorScheme from the theme
mode. Covered by test_qt_color_scheme_model.
